=== Editor Contrib - Copy Lines Command > copy first line down
config: {"autoClosingPairs":[],"surroundingPairs":[],"brackets":[],"lineComment":null,"blockComment":null}
text: "first\nsecond line\nthird line\nfourth line\nfifth"
setSelections 1 3 1 1
cmd editor.action.copyLinesDownAction
expectText "first\nfirst\nsecond line\nthird line\nfourth line\nfifth"
expectSel 2 3 2 1

